WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.340
Imagine a foot complaining:
I'm not a hand,

2
00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:05.570
so I'm not part of the body.

3
00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:09.440
Paul used that picture in a
letter to Christians in Corinth.

4
00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:13.890
They were divided, and competing
over whose gifts mattered most.

5
00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:16.920
Today, some village churches close.

6
00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:20.780
One headline reads:
village loses its church.

7
00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:23.360
If every church building closed tomorrow,

8
00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:25.650
would the Church still exist?

9
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:29.810
In this mission, you'll read Paul's
picture of a single body made of different

10
00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:33.860
parts: eye, hand, foot and ear.

11
00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:36.620
Then you'll read how the first
Christians shared teaching,

12
00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:39.810
bread and prayer in Acts chapter 2.

13
00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:44.510
Your mission: find out whether the Church
could survive without its buildings.
